    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scenarios that stress the interaction between the guest and the emulator&apos;s PFIFO / PGRAPH processing: how work is submitted, CPU access to GPU-rendered memory, waits on GPU reports, and presenting at less than the display rate. Each test is built from the same tiny triangles, so Control serves as the baseline for draw cost.</para>
<para>In sustained mode each test&apos;s work per frame is scaled by its &quot;load&quot; knob. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
